  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event Relevancy Screening with its own work list (stand-in)\nIgnores what the parent sends. **My work list** selects the rows that carry `duplicate` or `unique` and do not carry `relevant` or `irrelevant` yet. Each row is tagged as soon as it is done. Returns one item with the count, also when there was nothing to do.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 620
      },
